    region rule-customer (
        name: Customer Intelligence
        type: staticContent
        source {
            htmlCode:
                ```html
                <div class="ds-purchase-section">
                  <h2>Customer Intelligence</h2>
                  <p>Who the book depends on. Top customers and the customer performance table
                     drill to Customer Analysis; the concentration donut deliberately ignores
                     the customer filter, because a concentration measure narrowed to one
                     customer is meaningless.</p>
                </div>
                ```
